  </section>

  <footer>
    <b>About the thing on your desk</b>
    <p>
      A 1.47-inch panel driven by an ESP32-C6, with the rendering done on your
      Mac so the firmware never has to change. The crab, the rock pool and the
      sky you are looking at are all the same four colours the device uses at
      dusk.
    </p>
    <p>
      If he ever stops moving, open Terminal, go to the project folder and run
      <code>pnpm tamaclaude status</code>. It will tell you which of the two
      usual things has gone wrong, and
      <a href="/j/setup/">the setup page</a> says what to do about each.
    </p>
  </footer>
